{"text": "Just then Toto jumped out of Dorothys arms and hid under the bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While the girl tried to get him, Aunt Em threw open the trap door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Badly frightened, she climbed down the ladder into the small, dark hole. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last Dorothy caught Toto and started to follow her aunt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she was halfway across the room, there came a great shriek from the wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The house shook so hard that she lost her footing and sat down suddenly on the floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a strange thing happened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The house whirled around two or three times and rose slowly through the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The north wind and the south wind met at the very place where the house stood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That place became the exact center of the cyclone, where the air is usually still. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the strong wind on every side pushed the house higher and higher. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the very top of the cyclone, it was carried miles and miles away as easily as a feather.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "T", "o", "t", "o", " ", "j", "u", "m", "p", "e", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "D", "o", "r", "o", "t", "h", "y", "s", " ", "a", "r", "m", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "d", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "i", "l", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", " ", "t", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "g", "e", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", ",", " ", "A", "u", "n", "t", " ", "E", "m", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "w", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "a", "p", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", 